{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Euler类"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“Euler 类”"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>对于 $r$ 维实向量丛 $E\\to X$, 其 Euler 类是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Thom类","text":"Thom 类"}},{"Plain":" $u\\in H^r(E)$ 拉回到 $H^r(X)$ 中的像.</p>\n<h2>与 Euler 数的关系</h2>\n<p>可定向流形的切丛的 Euler 类在整个流形上的积分等于流形的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Euler示性数","text":"Euler 示性数"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>与曲率 2-形式的关系</h2>\n<p>当存在度量"},{"Local":{"url":"联络","text":"联络"}},{"Plain":"时, Euler 类可用"},{"Local":{"url":"曲率形式","text":"曲率形式"}},{"Plain":"的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Pfaff型","text":"Pfaff 型"}},{"Plain":"构造.</p>\n<h2>与陈类的联系</h2>\n<p>$d$ 维"},{"Local":{"url":"复向量丛","text":"复向量丛"}},{"Plain":"可为 (带定向) 实向量丛, 其 Euler 类是最高"},{"Local":{"url":"陈类","text":"陈类"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\ne(E) = c_d(E)\\in H^{2d}(X).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}